          "text": "LABORATORY COURIER SERVICE\nPickups are made at 9:00 A.M. and 4:00 P.M. on weekdays. Request forms received at least 30 minutes before a pickup will be included. Hazardous materials require special labels. The courier does not operate on weekends."
